    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1805">

                <pb facs="1181" n="1065" xml:id="pg1065"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 823.00/146.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister McMillin.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-03-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 27, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your March 26th. Discreetly inform interested parties that Legation can not be in
                    any way party to schemes of any political faction and that under circumstances
                    mentioned asylum would be refused.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
